WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.569
Hi! Let me show you the people (and animals) I love!

2
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:10.316
These are my grandparents. I love them!

3
00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:12.995
I visit them every Sunday.

4
00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:19.564
This is my brother, Paulo. He lives in another city.

5
00:00:20.014 --> 00:00:22.011
I call him every day.

6
00:00:24.261 --> 00:00:27.605
And this is my new kitten. Isn't it cute?

7
00:00:28.055 --> 00:00:30.145
I play with it every morning.

8
00:00:32.395 --> 00:00:36.342
This is my best friend, Ana. She always helps me.

9
00:00:36.792 --> 00:00:38.835
She calls me when I'm sad.

10
00:00:41.085 --> 00:00:45.683
My friends and I study together. Our teacher loves us!

11
00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.012
And you? Who do you call every day?

